# Keep the build context small. The graders' build only needs fast/ and the
# generator's source (Cargo.toml, Cargo.lock, src/), which the Dockerfile uses to
# make PGO training data. generator/target/ is excluded by **/target/ below.
# Without this, the context includes ~4 MB of dev-answer plus three copies of
# the 36 fixtures, none of which the image uses.

.git
.github
.claude

# Generated datasets and run output
dev/
dev*/
out/
scratch/

# Build artifacts
**/target/
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# The published answer and the starter kits are development aids only
dev-answer/
starter-duckdb/
starter-polars/
starter-pyspark/

# Docs
*.md
LICENSE
